  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9gIcfwN.png\" width=\"1152\" height=\"660\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/cwqwNx3TGE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/574476444366012420?label=Discord&amp;color=252a36&amp;labelColor=5865F2&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"202\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mandalacreations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mandalacreations&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;color=252A36&amp;labelColor=FF424D&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF\" width=\"196\" height=\"28\"><br></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/theismarius\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/follow-@theismarius-white?label=追蹤&amp;color=252a36&amp;labelColor=1D9BF0&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/CesarZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/follow-@cesarzorak-white?label=追蹤&amp;color=252a36&amp;labelColor=1D9BF0&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"214\" height=\"28\"></a></strong><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>關於：</strong></span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></p><p>釀造指南是對釀造台介面的增強，風格符合 Minecraft 原版。</p><p>忘記在網路上搜尋如何在 Minecraft 製作藥水的指南吧，現在你可以在遊戲內直接查看，無需安裝模組。<br>這是專為喜歡原版增強風格（Vanilla+）的玩家設計的。<br>它僅改變 Minecraft 釀造台的用戶介面，不會修改任何物品或方塊。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>特色：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li>介面風格與原版相容。</li>\n<li>採用原版色彩調色盤。</li>\n<li>材質僅為視覺效果 [並非原版的合成書功能]。</li>\n<li>風格類似村民交易介面。</li>\n</ul><p>此主題相容於版本 1.18.2 至 1.19.4<br>若發現任何錯誤，歡迎在 Discord 上回報。<br>別忘了查看 Mandala's Creations 的 Patreon！我們會上傳所有專案的預覽內容，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/project/patreon.com/mandalacreations\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這裡</a>。 ❤</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;如果你喜歡我的像素藝術風格，也可以試試：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-perspective\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's - Perspective</a> [相容於多個 Minecraft 版本、其他材質包及模組]<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode/files/4474251\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's - Veganicon</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode/files/4474251\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;快捷欄</a> [需手動下載並複製]<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-brewing-guide-on\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's - Brewing Guide On</a> [原版風格]<br><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's GUI - 深色模式</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-white-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's GUI - 淺色模式</a><br><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fantasy-ores-by-cesarzorak\" rel=\"nofollow\">CesarZorak 的奇幻礦石<br></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fantasy-ores-modded-by-cesarzorak\" rel=\"nofollow\">CesarZorak 的奇幻礦石</a> [模組版]</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4r5WLBc.png\" width=\"1152\" height=\"300\"></a></p><p style=\"text-alig